  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Academic worksheet",
    "overview": "Physics practice uses an academic worksheet as its visual authority: readable mathematical prose, precise diagrams, and a familiar code editor. Preserve the established green and white controls and the original CodeMirror theme. The exact bundled LaTeX.css from gadmaj/website supplies the typesetting foundation; application CSS adapts it to the workbench.\n\nInformation stays in a flat document flow with thin rules, optional disclosures, and explicit actions. Latin Modern gives questions their academic character, while Arial keeps controls compact and monospace preserves code structure.",
